# What {{customer.name}} wants

(Written in the customer's own words. `init.mjs` writes this skeleton once; replace it, then post
it with `node postbrief.mjs BRIEF.md "Request: <title>"`. Nothing is done until the customer has
seen it work.)

## The goal in one paragraph

What do you want, and why? Who is it for?

## What it must do

- Concrete behaviour, as a person would describe it ("when I click X, Y appears").
- Examples with real data.

## What it must not do

- Things that would be wrong or dangerous (who must never see what, what must never be deleted).

## How I will judge it

- "Done" means I have seen it work: the screens, at desktop and phone width, and the edge cases above.

## Questions I already know about

- Anything undecided, with your default if the team has to guess.
